      Poster
      <div class="product-card reveal reveal-delay-3" data-product='{"id":4,"name":"Poster illustré — Les Prophètes","price":12.99,"icon":"🖼️"}'>
        <div class="product-image">
          <div class="product-image-bg"></div>
          <div class="product-image-emoji">🖼️</div>
        </div>
        <div class="product-body">
          <div class="product-name" data-i18n="prod4.name">Poster illustré — Les Prophètes</div>
          <div class="product-desc" data-i18n="prod4.desc">Poster A3 premium illustrant la timeline des 25 Prophètes de l'Islam. Idéal pour la chambre d'enfant ou la salle de classe.</div>
          <div class="product-footer">
            <div class="product-price"><span class="currency">€</span>12,99 <span class="old-price">€ 16,99</span></div>
            <button class="add-to-cart" onclick="addToCart(this)" data-i18n="shop.add">+ Panier</button>
